{"ev":"session/update","data":{"kind":"tool_call","update":{"sessionUpdate":"tool_call","toolCallId":"exec-57238c93-6c35-4ff3-a8d6-2074feab50c2","title":"Editing files","kind":"edit","status":"in_progress","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/private/var/folders/qp/3hqcn7d50275mchzkqwqxhww0000gn/T/acp-spike-81913/README.md","newText":"# Tiny Project\n\nA minimal Python project that prints `hello`.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Python 3\n\n## Usage\n\nRun the program from the project root:\n\n```sh\npython3 main.py\n```\n\nExpected output:\n\n```text\nhello\n```\n\n## Project files\n\n- `main.py` — prints `hello`.\n- `hello.txt` — contains the auxiliary text `hi`.\n","_meta":{"kind":"add"}}]}}}
